    diasporaVariation: `The Fex are the most widely diasporic non-human race because they built, and maintain, the geothermal infrastructure connecting every region. Brasskin guild-halls exist in every capital (Merrowport, Greymark, Atropolis, the Frozen Archive, Harath-Vault, Synod Hold), each staffed by Brasskin who have lived local for generations and speak the local tongue with a Fex accent. These diaspora Brasskin are culturally flexible in a way the Frostmaw-pure Brasskin distrust. The Alchemite clan-nomads roam between all regions on maintenance-circuits and are functionally a trans-national people, an Alchemite speaks seven regional dialects and claims no capital.`,
    meaningfulTradeoffs: 'Fex craft and oral knowledge pair with conductive-graft vulnerability and the recorded Still-Air limitations. Guild secrecy, Groven relations and Sumpborn recognition offer political conflicts without making every engineer responsible for every experiment.',

